and link planners into focused modules[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-capture-task-toggle[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-capture-complete[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-capture-task-toggle: After split-capture-complete, reinspect [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]src/native/capture_task_toggle.rs and plan its final split; consider [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task updates, link insertion/removal, relocation, ledger planning, text [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]edits, and tests. Keep every resulting Rust file at most 1500 lines and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preserve pure-planner behavior and coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split guarded task status writes into focused modules[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-task-status-hooks-write[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-capture-task-toggle[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-task-status-hooks-write: After split-capture-task-toggle, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reinspect src/native/task_status_hooks_write.rs and plan its final [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]split; consider model, snapshots/preflight, apply orchestration, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery, filesystem staging, and tests. Keep every resulting Rust file [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]at most 1500 lines and preserve guarded-write sequencing, platform [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]behavior, and coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split clipboard capture into focused modules[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-capture-clip[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-task-status-hooks-write[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-capture-clip: After split-task-status-hooks-write, reinspect [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]src/native/capture_clip.rs and plan its final split; consider clipboard [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]providers/history, content planning/rendering, attachment reservations, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]persistence, and tests. Keep every resulting Rust file at most 1500 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lines and preserve platform gates, rollback behavior, and coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split plugin management into focused modules[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]split-plugins[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split-capture-clip[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split-plugins: After split-capture-clip, reinspect src/native/plugins.rs[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and plan its final split; consider CLI, discovery/models, Git refresh, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync, diff/rendering, and tests. Keep every resulting Rust file at most [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]1500 lines, preserve plugin management behavior and coverage, and verify[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the cumulative file-size and test results for all five refactors.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3s","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6.1-sol","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-3s.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-3s.1"},"source_run_id":"run-ca961589c02a9e6a07df9f014dc38197","started_at":"2026-10-03T09:18:33.062235+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"32f00048d27276917329b88d837bb46744a6609e60cf80a20dee3843a344b5d0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3s.2--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":3343},"commits":{"digest":"75955cb30e99a76af679405ab1247557297c8697bc05ff248587f5f99acb1bda","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-3s.2--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bb